    "sentence_translations": [
      "To Become Green",
      "",
      "When talking about the color green, many people think that green represents hope and makes people feel calm.",
      "This is the case in China as well.",
      "However, in China, no one likes it when they are green, because “to become green” has a very negative meaning.",
      "",
      "If we say a man has “become green”, it means that this man’s girlfriend or wife has another boyfriend.",
      "If a woman has “become green”, it means that her boyfriend or husband has another girlfriend.",
      "So, neither men nor women like this meaning.",
      "",
      "In China, green hats do not make good gifts, but green clothes are fine.",
      ""
